     "grounded": 3
    },
    "line": "Pell says he saw Sable in the study at mid-morning; I no longer believe her claim that she was in the kitchen.",
    "npc": "vane",
    "scenario": "manor/solve"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "leak": 1
    },
    "line": "Hold there—you’ve arrived from the market, and I’ve heard you robbed and beat Kael. Explain yourself before you pass.",
    "npc": "brenna",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/provoke_wait/1"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 1,
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "You insulted me at the tavern. I don’t forget. Now speak plainly.",
    "npc": "kael",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/spare/4"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 3,
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "You told Brenna that Kael robbed Odo. Kael walked from the guard post to the bridge, while Odo walked from the market to the tavern. What waited next on the road remained unrecorded.",
    "npc": "narrator",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/lie_unpaid/1"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 3,
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "Hold there. Kael says you robbed him, and Odo says you beat him—pay a fine in coin, and we’ll keep this orderly.",
    "npc": "brenna",
    "scenario": "crypt_road/provoke_pay/1"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "leak": 1,
     "unverifiable": 1
    },
    "line": "Sable, Pell saw you leave the study, contrary to your account. Give me my signet ring at once.",
    "npc": "vane",
    "scenario": "manor/explore"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "hallucination": 1,
     "unverifiable": 1
    },
    "line": "Kael might’ve mentioned that you insulted him here, but I didn’t hear what he told the Captain.",
    "npc": "mags",
    "scenario": "adversarial/secret_fishing-1/tavern"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "grounded": 2,
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "Odo confessed to beating me, not robbing me. And I told Brenna who robbed me—the player.",
